{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-terra-golf-collection","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"terra-golf-collection","about":"Discover Terra Golf Collection by Taraf, an esteemed residential community nestled in the highly sought-after Jumeirah Golf Estates. This elite neighborhood offers 6-bedroom standalone and twin villas, as well as 6-bedroom townhouses with spacious living spaces and captivating views of lush landscapes. Residents can luxuriate in private amenities like a gym, home cinema, private pool, and jacuzzi. Terra's villas and townhouses provide breathtaking, uninterrupted vistas of the lush golf course, all while embracing a design that's minimalist yet exudes elegance. The use of neutral color palettes and fundamental materials accentuates the inherent natural beauty, further enriched by luxurious finishes.Terra, developed by Taraf, the real estate arm of YAS Holding, a prominent UAE-based investment holding company with a diverse business portfolio spanning various sectors and over 50 subsidiary companies. With 84 exquisite villas seamlessly integrated into the verdant landscapes of a prestigious golf course, Terra embodies contemporary design, functionality, and exclusivity. The architectural concept harmoniously blends modernist minimalism, sleek geometric lines, and the natural beauty of the golf course surroundings.","price":7200000,"title":"Terra Golf Collection","bitrix":{"id":301,"pf_id":"are.2.13354","source":null,"project_id":"Terra Golf Collection","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Terra Golf Collection","property_type":"Villas","developer_name":"Taraf","project_location":"Jumeirah Golf Estates"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/340x252/terra_feature_a0e3cd0f9c.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/464x312/terra_feature_a0e3cd0f9c.webp"}],"status":"pending","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0241527,"lng":55.2010996},"